{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QTorsionLeaf","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QTorsionLeaf","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.NatTrans","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.ExteriorAlgebra.Basic"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QTorsionLeaf.flow_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QTorsionLeaf.flow_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L88-L88","doc":"Flow invariance: `φ^q_t(L) = L` for all `t ∈ ℝ`.\n\nThe binder said `t : R_q` while this docstring said `t ∈ ℝ` — the prose\nwas right and the type was not. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QTorsionLeaf.tangent_in_horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QTorsionLeaf.tangent_in_horizontal","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Tangent inclusion `T_p L ⊂ H_p` for all `p ∈ L` (integrality of the\nhorizontal distribution).  Formalised as: for any Reeb decomposition\nwith the leaf as support, the vertical component vanishes on the leaf. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QTorsionLeaf.nonempty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QTorsionLeaf.nonempty","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L78-L78","doc":"The leaf is non-empty. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QTorsionLeaf.leaf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QTorsionLeaf.leaf","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L76-L76","doc":"The leaf as a subset of `M`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QTorsionLeaf.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QTorsionLeaf.mk","kind":"ctor","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L74-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QTorsionLeaf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QTorsionLeaf","kind":"structure","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L70-L89","doc":"**q-Torsion leaf**: a maximal integral submanifold `L ↪ M` of `H`\nthat is invariant under the q-deformed Reeb flow.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:q-torsion-leaf}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:q-torsion-leaf","label":"ex:q-torsion-leaf","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow.flow_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow.flow_zero","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L68-L68","doc":"Initial condition: `φ^q_0 = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow.flow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow.flow","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L66-L66","doc":"The flow map at time `t : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow.mk","kind":"ctor","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow","kind":"structure","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L55-L68","doc":"**q-deformed Reeb flow** (local prerequisite, mirroring `QOU.QReebFlow`).\n\nFlow time is `ℝ`. This docstring used to say \"over the ground ring `R_q`\"\nand to note, without resolving it, that *\"the library counterpart\n`QOU.QReebFlow` evaluates time over `ℝ`\"* — a divergence recorded in prose\nand enforced by nothing (bean `qou-u87j`). `q-reeb-flow.md` settles it in\nfavour of `ℝ`: the flow is defined \"in the archimedean realisation\" by the\nODE `d/dt φ_t^q = ξ_q ∘ φ_t^q`. The `q` deforms the vector field, not the\ntime parameter. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:q-reeb-flow","label":"ex:q-reeb-flow","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.decomp","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Decomposition identity: `total = horizontal + vertical`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.vertical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.vertical","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Vertical component `α_V = θ ∧ ι_ξ α`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.horizontal","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Horizontal component `α_H` satisfying `ι_ξ α_H = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.total","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The total form (abstract representative). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition","kind":"structure","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L42-L53","doc":"**Reeb decomposition** `α = α_H + α_V` of a differential form on a CR\nmanifold (local prerequisite for the leaf integrality condition; the\nlibrary counterpart is `QOU.ReebDecomposition`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:reeb-decomposition","label":"ex:reeb-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_param","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-torsion-leaf.lean#L34-L36","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]` (Laurent polynomials over ℤ).\nSee `QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing` for the compiled definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}